  "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"entry-content\"><div class=\"wpb-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_left wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper   vc_box_border_grey\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"501\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/08/Saxenda2.jpg.webp\" class=\"vc_single_image-img attachment-full\" alt=\"Display Saxenda pen injector\" title=\"Saxenda2\"></div>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 60px;text-align: right\" class=\"vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading vc_custom_1565191448218\">Saxenda: A New Injectable Weight Loss Drug</h1><div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_separator_no_text vc_sep_color_grey wpb_content_element  wpb_content_element\"><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span>\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Other Weight Loss Medications</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/apidex/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_border  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"vc_single_image-img \" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2018/10/shutterstock_308571731-300x200.jpg.webp\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Adipex\" title=\"Adipex-P\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2018/10/shutterstock_308571731-300x200.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2018/10/shutterstock_308571731-660x441.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2018/10/shutterstock_308571731-768x513.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2018/10/shutterstock_308571731.jpg.webp 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/plenity\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_border  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"vc_single_image-img \" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/plenity-300x200.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"plenity\" title=\"plenity\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-6\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<p>Saxenda (generic: liraglutide) is derived from the diabetes medication Victoza.&nbsp; Researchers found that patients who were on Victoza frequently lost a small amount of weight.&nbsp; Eventually, studies were done utilizing Victoza at double the regular dose and its effect on weight loss, and results revealed that patients who were taking Saxenda lost more weight than those on a placebo, and the results were statistically significant.&nbsp; This led to FDA approval of a 3mg dose of Victoza for weight loss, but under the name Saxenda.</p>\n<p>Saxenda is injected from a pre-filled pen with a dial to adjust the dosage, similar to many diabetes medications.&nbsp; The dosage is increased gradually over several days until 3mg is reached.&nbsp; Generally the medication is well-tolerated, with the most common side effects being nausea and diarrhea.&nbsp; Patients on Saxenda will be required to have monthly office visits to meet with a medical provider and a registered dietitian.</p>\n<p>Saxenda works by interacting with GLP-1 receptors in your body.&nbsp; GLP-1 (glucagon-like peptide) is an appetite hormone that is naturally produced in humans that helps to regulate hunger.&nbsp; Saxenda works like GLP-1 by regulating your appetite, which leads to decrease calorie consumption and therefore weight loss.</p>\n<p>Saxenda, being a new medication, can cost upwards of $1000/month for patients without insurance coverage, so it is important to explore your options.&nbsp; If you are interested in Saxenda please <a href=\"https://journeylite.com/do-i-have-coverage-for-saxenda/\">click here</a> to find out about coverage prior to requesting an appointment.</p>\n<p>It is always exciting to see new treatment options for weight loss coming to fruition, and JourneyLite Physicians is proud to be on the forefront of fighting the disease of obesity!</p>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-12\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\"><div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_shadow vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_sep_color_black wpb_content_element\"><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span>\n</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\"><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Infosession</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/infosession-part-one/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"vc_single_image-img \" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/12/graphicstock-man-using-digital-device-make-payments-online-shopping-and-icon-customer-network-connection-on-screen_rukg_UoPxje-e1576513156111-300x200.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"man looking at some information on his digital devices\" title=\"graphicstock-man-using-digital-device-make-payments-online-shopping-and-icon-customer-network-connection-on-screen_rukg_UoPxje\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Meet Dr. Curry online!</h3>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">Navigator</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/infosession-part-one/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"vc_single_image-img \" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/navigator-300x200.jpg.webp\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"navigating with a compass\" title=\"weight loss navigator\" loading=\"lazy\" srcset=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/navigator-300x200.jpg.webp 300w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/navigator-660x440.jpg.webp 660w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/navigator-768x511.jpg.webp 768w, https://journeylite.com/wp-content/smush-webp/2019/05/navigator.jpg.webp 1000w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Interactive Online Weight Loss Navigator</h3>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div><div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-4\"><div class=\"vc_column-inner\"><div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_single_image wpb_content_element vc_align_center wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<h2 class=\"wpb_heading wpb_singleimage_heading\">eStore</h2>\n\t\t<figure class=\"wpb_wrapper vc_figure\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/shop/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"vc_single_image-img \" src=\"https://journeylite.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/03/Chewy-300x200.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Fast Track Chewy Bars\" title=\"Chewy Bars\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n\t\t</figure>\n\t</div>\n\n\t<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Protein, Vitamins, &amp; More!</h3>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n</div></div>",
  "bodyMarkdown": "# Saxenda: A New Injectable Weight Loss Drug\n\n## Other Weight Loss Medications\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/weight-loss-medications/apidex/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_border  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/plenity\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_border  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\nSaxenda (generic: liraglutide) is derived from the diabetes medication Victoza.  Researchers found that patients who were on Victoza frequently lost a small amount of weight.  Eventually, studies were done utilizing Victoza at double the regular dose and its effect on weight loss, and results revealed that patients who were taking Saxenda lost more weight than those on a placebo, and the results were statistically significant.  This led to FDA approval of a 3mg dose of Victoza for weight loss, but under the name Saxenda.\n\nSaxenda is injected from a pre-filled pen with a dial to adjust the dosage, similar to many diabetes medications.  The dosage is increased gradually over several days until 3mg is reached.  Generally the medication is well-tolerated, with the most common side effects being nausea and diarrhea.  Patients on Saxenda will be required to have monthly office visits to meet with a medical provider and a registered dietitian.\n\nSaxenda works by interacting with GLP-1 receptors in your body.  GLP-1 (glucagon-like peptide) is an appetite hormone that is naturally produced in humans that helps to regulate hunger.  Saxenda works like GLP-1 by regulating your appetite, which leads to decrease calorie consumption and therefore weight loss.\n\nSaxenda, being a new medication, can cost upwards of $1000/month for patients without insurance coverage, so it is important to explore your options.  If you are interested in Saxenda please (https://journeylite.com/do-i-have-coverage-for-saxenda/) to find out about coverage prior to requesting an appointment.\n\nIt is always exciting to see new treatment options for weight loss coming to fruition, and JourneyLite Physicians is proud to be on the forefront of fighting the disease of obesity!\n\n## Infosession\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/infosession-part-one/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n### Meet Dr. Curry online!\n\n## Navigator\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/infosession-part-one/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n### Interactive Online Weight Loss Navigator\n\n## eStore\n\n<a href=\"https://journeylite.com/shop/\" target=\"_self\" class=\"vc_single_image-wrapper vc_box_shadow_3d  vc_box_border_grey\"></a>\n\n### Protein, Vitamins, & More!",
